<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NB - no buyer T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	BASIS	 MONTH	   PREV</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	  12/9  D	April	  12/9  D</p>
<p> May	    12/9  D	May	    12/9  D</p>
<p> July	  2 D/even	July	  2 D/even</p>
<p> August	 10/15 P	August	 10/15 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS     MONTH	  PREV</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	    1.5/1  D   April	 1.5/1   D</p>
<p> May		 11/8  D   May	    11/8   D</p>
<p> July		16/10 D   July	   16/10  D</p>
<p> August	     7/3  D   August	  7/3   D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	  130/115 D   April    130/115 D</p>
<p> May	    160/130 D   May	160/130 D</p>
<p> July	   175/130 D   July     175/130 D</p>
<p> August	 170/120 D   August   170/120 D</p>
